OL,3,AWelsh actress follows in footsteps of
OL,4,AFlorence Pugh and Benedict Cumberbatch
OL,5,Ain line-up
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Welsh actress named in a prestigious
OL,8,Fline-up that has previously featured
OL,9,Fthe likes of Benedict Cumberbatch and
OL,10,FFlorence Pugh says the selection was
OL,11,F"so unexpected" that she forgot she
OL,12,Fapplied.
OL,14,FLeisa Gwenllian portrays Effi in the
OL,15,FWelsh language film Effi o Blaenau,
OL,16,Fwhich follows a young woman as she
OL,17,Fgrapples with unemployment in a north
OL,18,FWales town before a night out drinking
OL,19,Fdramatically alters her life.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
