OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWelsh actress follows in footsteps of
OL,4,AFlorence Pugh and Benedict Cumberbatch
OL,5,Ain line-up
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe joins a host of Hollywood stars who
OL,8,Fhave previously been part of Stars of
OL,9,FTomorrow, an annual showcase
OL,10,Fhighlighting rising British and Irish
OL,11,Facting and filmmaking talent.
OL,13,FGwenllian said she was proud to receive
OL,14,Fthe honour and that Welsh language
OL,15,Fcinema was currently "having a moment".
